    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a 'tough time' though. i feel like i'm fundamentally broken. like the engine is gone and there's just this hollow shell left behind. i look at my old work and it feels like it was written by a stranger. a better person. i'm just taking up oxygen at this point, making noise with no meaning. it's exhausting pretending to be someone who still has something to contribute.",
